research/audit/wave7-refuter-tasks/thm-compact-hausdorff-space-has-a-unique-compatible-uniformity.md-61-2.1 By steps 1.2 and 1.3, the cover structure associated to $\mathcal U$ consists exactly of the covers admitting an open refinement, which is the structure in [L1]. [L1, step 1.2, step 1.3]
