research/audit/wave7-dispatch/certifier-a6-final-cor-compact-domain-maps-are-uniformly-continuous.log-224-
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/certifier-a6-final-cor-compact-domain-maps-are-uniformly-continuous.log-225-1.1 Let $V$ be a target entourage and choose a symmetric $W$ with $W^{-1}\circ W=W^{\circ2}\subseteq V$. For each $x\in X$, let $O_x$ be the union of all open sets $O$ such that $x\in O$ and $f[O]\subseteq W[f(x)]$. Continuity makes this family nonempty, and its union is an open neighbourhood of $x$ satisfying $f[O_x]\subseteq W[f(x)]$. [L2, L3, construct]
