research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-topology-uniform.log-270266-+          "quote": "Let $K \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}$. Then $K$ is compact ([[def-open-cover-r]]) if and\nonly if $K$ is closed ([[def-open-and-closed-in-r]]) and bounded\n([[def-bounded-set]]).",
